{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/16809-system-interaction-questions","id":16809,"title":"System interaction Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-23T14:49:45-08:00","id":16809,"title":"System interaction Questions","content":"New to new world of darkness played many old world Demon games so I have a couple of questions about the new rule set and system.<br /> <br /> Pacts: Can a demon make a pact for physical appearances?(can the demon make a pact with a human to change faces?) If so what level of pact would that be. If not how do you decide what a patchwork cover looks like?<br /> <br /> Can a demon write a pact in invisible ink or super small text?<br /> <br /> Going Loud: If you have 1 primum and go loud do you have 10 aether or 100?<br /> <br /> Cover: Do investigations into a demon need to have full context to make a compromise roll or do you make a roll whenever anyone suspects demonic activity? Basically someone finds the contracts you have made hidden in the forest written in blood and set in stone tablets do you make a roll imminently or do you wait till they can associate those contracts with a specific person? What if the tablets found are not yours but you are suspected does that mean there should be a compromise roll?<br /> <br /> I would also appreciate some advice on how to rule these situations. <br /> <br /> Should players be able to make a soul pact with a person and fill the mortal side with benefits to negate the willpower cost on the part of the demon if the demon is just going to take the soul immediately. <br /> Can someone recommend a limit on the inspiring merit? It could be used to to generated infinite willpower between 2 players. But since this kinda thing is manageable considering my players I just don't want to say I will arbitrarily decide when it can work or not. Once a scene seems a little much would once a session be alright?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1151-walkingeye","name":"WalkingEye","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1151_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T17:11:31-08:00","id":16877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WalkingEye</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/16809-system-interaction-questions#post16809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">New to new world of darkness played many old world Demon games so I have a couple of questions about the new rule set and system.<br /> <br /> Pacts: Can a demon make a pact for physical appearances?(can the demon make a pact with a human to change faces?) If so what level of pact would that be. If not how do you decide what a patchwork cover looks like?</div> </div> </div> </div>Physical appearance is a bit of a fuzzy area. I'd allow it as a medial aspect. A patchwork cover sort of accretes elements from the different people it was formed from. Out of character, I'd encourage a player to make up the appearance themselves, but include some memorable trait from one of the sources.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WalkingEye</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/16809-system-interaction-questions#post16809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can a demon write a pact in invisible ink or super small text?</div> </div> </div> </div>The pactee has to know what they're signing. The demon can be deceptive about the nature of the deal or its full ramifications, but if a term is in the contract, the person signing has to know it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WalkingEye</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/16809-system-interaction-questions#post16809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Going Loud: If you have 1 primum and go loud do you have 10 aether or 100?</div> </div> </div> </div>100. Though I could see an argument for 10. Basically, though, going loud is suppose to make you ultra-powerful at the cost of your whole identity.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WalkingEye</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/16809-system-interaction-questions#post16809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cover: Do investigations into a demon need to have full context to make a compromise roll or do you make a roll whenever anyone suspects demonic activity? Basically someone finds the contracts you have made hidden in the forest written in blood and set in stone tablets do you make a roll imminently or do you wait till they can associate those contracts with a specific person? What if the tablets found are not yours but you are suspected does that mean there should be a compromise roll?</div> </div> </div> </div>Somewhere in between. When they develop some leads on the owner of those pacts, compromise becomes a risk, but they don't have to be investigating one specific person.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WalkingEye</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/16809-system-interaction-questions#post16809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Should players be able to make a soul pact with a person and fill the mortal side with benefits to negate the willpower cost on the part of the demon if the demon is just going to take the soul immediately.</div> </div> </div> </div>Generally, no. A soul pact should give the human some room to indulge the benefits of the pact.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WalkingEye</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/16809-system-interaction-questions#post16809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can someone recommend a limit on the inspiring merit? It could be used to to generated infinite willpower between 2 players. But since this kinda thing is manageable considering my players I just don't want to say I will arbitrarily decide when it can work or not. Once a scene seems a little much would once a session be alright?</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't allow a loop of mutual inspiration at all. If someone inspired you, you don't get to inspire them back.<br /> <br /> Now, that means that there's no mechanical benefit for two people working each other up into a frenzy, but given the overall mechanics of the situation, I don't think it makes sense to allow it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 11-23-2013, 08:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T17:37:40-08:00","id":16882,"title":"","content":"Thanks Rose. Helped me a ton.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1151-walkingeye","name":"WalkingEye","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1151_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}